{# One file sent with the issue from the widget (`uuid`, `name`): its picture when the frame took or chose it, its name, the way to take it back, and what the form carries of it. The screenshot (`data-capture`, set by the form) shows its picture whole, over the width of the panel: it is checked before the issue is sent. The form also draws it once in a <template>, for the files sent while it is filled. #}
<li class="group flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-line bg-surface px-2 py-1.5 text-sm" data-uuid="{{ uuid }}">
    <img alt="" class="h-10 w-16 shrink-0 rounded border border-line-subtle object-cover group-data-capture:h-auto group-data-capture:max-h-96 group-data-capture:w-full group-data-capture:object-contain" hidden>
    <span class="min-w-0 flex-1 truncate text-body">{{ name }}</span>
    <twig:Ui:IconButton icon="x" :label="'widget.form.remove_file'|trans({ '%name%': name })" data-action="widget-report#discard" />
    <input type="hidden" name="attachments[{{ uuid }}]" value="{{ name }}">
</li>
